'''Papuu's Paradox''' (絶・聖者ポプウ降臨, ''Zetsu・Seija Popuu Kōrin'', '''Absolute・Saint Popuu Advent''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] and appears on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''', and '''18th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Papuu's Paradise]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Cossack Cat]] - Royal Guard Cat.

